{
  "info": {
    "name": "Desafio XCL - Gerenciador de Tarefas",
    "description": "Coleção completa: autenticação, gestão de equipe (listar/adicionar/remover membros) e CRUD de tarefas.\n\nComo usar (caminho rápido):\n1. Rode 'Virar admin (dev)' com o e-mail/senha que quiser — funciona não importa o estado do banco: cria ou promove esse e-mail para admin e já autentica. Guarda o cookie em {{sid}} automaticamente.\n2. As demais requisições já reaproveitam {{sid}} no header Cookie.\n3. Para testar como membro, rode 'Login' com as credenciais de um membro (sobrescreve {{sid}}).\n\n'Bootstrap' e 'Criar conta do administrador' continuam aqui para testar o fluxo real de 1ª execução (só funciona com o banco vazio).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "sid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminName", "value": "Kauã Souza" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@xcl.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "admin123" },
    { "key": "memberName", "value": "Olivia Bennett" },
    { "key": "memberEmail", "value": "olivia@xcl.com" },
    { "key": "memberPassword", "value": "olivia123" },
    { "key": "memberId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Virar admin (dev) — qualquer e-mail, sempre funciona",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const setCookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (setCookie) {",
                  "  const match = setCookie.match(/sid=([^;]+)/);",
                  "  if (match) pm.collectionVariables.set('sid', match[1]);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('status 200 ou 201', () => pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
                  "pm.test('role = admin', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('admin'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{adminName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-admin", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "dev-admin"] },
            "description": "Atalho de desenvolvimento: autentica QUALQUER e-mail passado como admin, não importa o estado do banco. Se o e-mail já existe, promove para admin e atualiza a senha; se não existe, cria. Sempre loga (cookie salvo em {{sid}}).\n\n⚠️ Rota pensada para testes locais — não deixe exposta se este projeto sair do ambiente local."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Bootstrap (precisa criar admin?)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/bootstrap", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "bootstrap"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar conta do administrador (1ª vez, banco vazio)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const setCookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (setCookie) {",
                  "  const match = setCookie.match(/sid=([^;]+)/);",
                  "  if (match) pm.collectionVariables.set('sid', match[1]);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('role = admin', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.eql('admin'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{adminName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Só funciona quando o banco ainda não tem nenhum usuário (ver 'Bootstrap'). O usuário criado aqui vira admin e herda tarefas antigas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const setCookie = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (setCookie) {",
                  "  const match = setCookie.match(/sid=([^;]+)/);",
                  "  if (match) pm.collectionVariables.set('sid', match[1]);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Troque o body para {{memberEmail}} / {{memberPassword}} para testar as regras de um membro comum. Isso sobrescreve {{sid}} com a sessão desse usuário."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver perfil logado (/me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('sid', '');"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipe (admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar equipe",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] },
            "description": "Requer sessão de admin (feita via Autenticação > Login)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Adicionar membro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('memberId', pm.response.json()._id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{memberName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{memberEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{memberPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"member\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users"] },
            "description": "Requer sessão de admin. Salva o _id criado em {{memberId}}. 'role' pode ser \"member\" ou \"admin\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover membro",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{memberId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "{{memberId}}"] },
            "description": "Requer sessão de admin. Bloqueado (400) se for a própria conta ou o único administrador."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dashboard (admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Métricas da equipe (/stats)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/stats", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["stats"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tarefas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Healthcheck",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar tarefa",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', body._id);",
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('tem _id', () => pm.expect(body._id).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Minha primeira tarefa\",\n  \"description\": \"Criada pelo Postman\",\n  \"priority\": \"media\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["items"] },
            "description": "A tarefa nasce pertencendo a quem estiver logado em {{sid}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar tarefas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["items"] },
            "description": "Admin vê as tarefas de todos; membro vê só as próprias."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar tarefa por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["items", "{{itemId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar tarefa",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tarefa atualizada\",\n  \"status\": \"concluida\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["items", "{{itemId}}"] },
            "description": "403 se a tarefa não pertencer ao usuário logado (e ele não for admin)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover tarefa",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Cookie", "value": "sid={{sid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["items", "{{itemId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
